  "notes": {
    "manas-2010:p1048:b001:l007": "кызыталак abusive curse rendered bastards, not literal divorced daughter. Yudakhin талак https://el-sozduk.kg/талак/",
    "manas-2010:p1048:b001:l008": "олжомо my spoils retained; no unsupported substitution of my wife.",
    "manas-2010:p1048:b001:l026": "тел кулун foal fostered/suckled by another mare, qualified contextual gloss; no change to the printed eating of it.",
    "manas-2010:p1048:b001:l030": "кыярак уу: poison certain, exact modifier unconfirmed. Deadly is contextual to attempted killing; no identified chemical/plant or silent spelling correction. Whole phrase remains qualified.",
    "manas-2010:p1049:b001:l024": "кез traditional length unit rendered cubit in40high/40deep pair; no exact modern conversion.",
    "manas-2010:p1049:b001:l021": "көөр gem/precious stone, Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/көөр/; jeweled horse breastband, not soot.",
